  <ul>
    <li>What is stored and who can read it: <a href="/docs/security" class="link">Security</a>.</li>
    <li>Pointing an existing OTel setup at mcpd: <a href="/docs/opentelemetry" class="link">OpenTelemetry</a>.</li>
